logs/news/average-house-price-france\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"178\",\"title\":\"The Real Cost of Living in Paris in 2025: A Guide for Expats\",\"description\":\"Mar 7, 2025 · Property prices in Paris average around €10,418 per square meter. That's double the price you'd pay in other big French cities like Lyon or ...\",\"url\":\"https://en.parisrental.com/blog/living-better-in-paris/the-real-cost-of-living-in-paris-in-2025-a-guide-for-expats\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"179\",\"title\":\"Finding housing in Paris is getting harder – even for young people ...\",\"description\":\"Apr 26, 2025 · \\\"Young professionals in Paris have difficulty finding housing even though they have a higher average income than the national level [€22,930 ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.lemonde.fr/en/campus/article/2025/04/26/finding-housing-in-paris-is-getting-harder-even-for-young-people-making-good-money_6740657_11.html\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"180\",\"title\":\"French Housing Crisis: Will New Laws on Short-Term Rentals Solve ...\",\"description\":\"Nov 14, 2024 · The strict zoning laws and urban planning regulations in France make it challenging to adapt housing to the needs of modern communities.\",\"url\":\"https://adrianleeds.com/subscribe-to-our-publications/french-property-insider/fpi-archives/french-housing-crisis/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"181\",\"title\":\"The left's radical plan to fix housing in Paris | Financial Post\",\"description\":\"Sep 22, 2025 · Authorities are using an arsenal of interventionist tools to make city homes affordable. Critics call it an attack on property rights.\",\"url\":\"https://financialpost.com/financial-times/left-radical-plan-fix-housing-paris\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"182\",\"title\":\"The Social Project - Places Journal\",\"description\":\"After World War II, France evolved in less than three decades from a largely rural country with an outdated housing stock into a highly modernized urban nation.\",\"url\":\"https://placesjourn