e Explosion of the Parisian Theatre Scene: Facts and Figures\",\"description\":\"Jun 13, 2019 · Recent estimates count 130 theatres, showing around 300 shows per week, which can reach 450 in peak season. That's enough venues to outstrip both Broadway.\",\"url\":\"http://www.theatreinparis.com/blog/explosion-de-la-scene-theatrale-parisienne-faits-et-chiffres\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"257\",\"title\":\"Pillars - Comédie-Française\",\"description\":\"Since its creation in 1680, the Comédie-Française has constantly surprised and stood out as an exceptional, thriving and creative “theatre factory”.\",\"url\":\"https://www.comedie-francaise.fr/en/the-pillars\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"258\",\"title\":\"Three stages - Comédie-Française\",\"description\":\"Inaugurated in 1790 for the troupe of the Variétés amusantes, the Salle Richelieu has been the historical theatre of the Comédie-Française since 1799. Without ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.comedie-francaise.fr/en/the-stages\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"259\",\"title\":\"France media guide - BBC News\",\"description\":\"Jun 19, 2023 · France has a free press and more than 100 daily newspapers. Most of them are in private hands and are not linked to political parties. Public ...\",\"url\":\"https://www.bbc.com/news/world-europe-17299010\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"260\",\"title\":\"4. Main sources used for news in France - Pew Research Center\",\"description\":\"Apr 23, 2019 · When asked which news source people turn to most frequently, those most commonly mentioned are TF1 (16%), BFM (15%) and France Télévisions/France TV (15%).\",\"url\":\"https://www.pewresearch.org/journalism/2019/04/23/main-sources-used-for-news-in-france/\",\"favicon\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"261\",\"title\":\"Early and Silent Film - French \u0026 Francophone Film: A Research Guide\",\"description\":\"Jul 3, 2025 · In 1895 in Paris, the brothers screened their film La Sortie de l'usine Lumière à Lyon (Workers Leaving the Lumière Factory in Lyon) for a